@startuml
!include business_symbols.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A9892
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #173F39
skinparam ActorBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ActorFontColor #173F39
skinparam EntityBorderColor #315E57
skinparam EntityFontColor #173F39
hide footbox

participant "<$business_actor>\n顾客" as Customer
participant "<$business_worker>\n受理门店员工" as Clerk
participant "<$business_entity>\n纸质租赁合同" as Paper
participant "<$business_entity>\nExcel 工作簿" as Excel
participant "<$business_worker>\n原门店员工" as Origin
participant "<$business_actor>\n第三方支付服务" as Pay

Customer -> Clerk : 提出换装或跨店归还申请(合同号、装备)
activate Clerk
Clerk -> Paper : 查找纸质合同和租期记录()
activate Paper
Paper --> Clerk : 返回合同记录
deactivate Paper
Clerk -> Excel : 查询装备、出租和门店记录()
activate Excel
Excel --> Clerk : 返回本店保存的记录
deactivate Excel

Clerk -> Origin : 电话核对合同、装备位置和出租状态()
activate Origin
Origin --> Clerk : 返回原门店登记信息
deactivate Origin
Clerk -> Clerk : 人工检查装备并计算差价、逾期或损坏费用()
opt 需要补款或退款
  Clerk -> Pay : 办理补款或退款(合同号、金额)
  activate Pay
  Pay --> Clerk : 返回支付调整结果
  deactivate Pay
end
Clerk -> Paper : 手工登记换装或归还结果()
activate Paper
Paper --> Clerk : 返回登记完成
deactivate Paper
Clerk -> Excel : 手工更新装备位置与状态()
activate Excel
Excel --> Clerk : 返回保存结果
deactivate Excel
Clerk -> Customer : 交付替换装备或归还凭证()
activate Customer
Customer --> Clerk : 返回确认
deactivate Customer
deactivate Clerk

@enduml
